      "source_prose_extracts": [
        "The Kraken is a stronger and larger version of the cave kraken . It requires level 87 Slayer to kill and cannot be boosted. Located at the Kraken Cove , it can only be attacked if the player has it, or cave krakens as a Slayer task , which also requires level 50 Magic . Alongside its non-boss variants , it is the only monster that drops the Kraken tentacle and charged Trident of the Seas .",
        "Players can create a Kraken instance for 25,000 coins. This fee can be deducted directly from the bank; players do not need to carry coins on them to create the instance. The boss respawns more slowly in a private instance than the public arena."
      ],
